#
# TLS configuration
#
config TLS
	tristate "Transport Layer Security support"
	depends on NET
	default m
	---help---
	Enable kernel support for TLS protocol. This allows symmetric
	encryption handling of the TLS protocol to be done in-kernel.

	If unsure, say M.
